<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  3.82%			 C/S =  2.04%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  ---			   O/N =  Par</p>
<p>	    T/N =  ---			   T/N =  2.55%</p>
<p>		   Jan  17, 1997			Jan 16, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.09%	1 month forward =  5.09%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.11%	2 month forward =  6.28%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.90%	3 month forward =  7.24%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.13%	4 month forward =  7.47%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.26%	5 month forward =  7.47%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.31%	6 month forward =  7.42%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
